WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Ryu jumps toward Manon.

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.070
OD Rond-point hits Ryu in the air as a Counter Hit.

3
00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:03.400
Light Renversé catches Ryu after the anti-air.

4
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.950
Manon throws Ryu at the end of Renversé.

5
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:05.350
The hit grab raises Manon from one medal to two.
